      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 12821,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 524361411,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789019929100,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "取舍：索引与 pool 管理更简单，重排 / 写入 shape 固定；代价是跨设备复制通信，以及输出和 pool 的重复存储。",
      "originalText": "取舍：索引与 pool 管理更简单，重排 / 写入 shape 固定；代价是跨设备复制通信，以及输出和 pool 的重复存储。",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b0R"
    },
    {
      "id": "epd-replicated-output-91",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 45,
      "y": 1315,
      "width": 1184,
      "height": 26,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#64748b",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 12952,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1207395053,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789019929100,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "“仅尾部 padding”描述重排后的输出；pool 仍按页存储。复制不是固定 shape 的唯一方案，分片输出需要额外的跨片索引与路由。",
      "originalText": "“仅尾部 padding”描述重排后的输出；pool 仍按页存储。复制不是固定 shape 的唯一方案，分片输出需要额外的跨片索引与路由。",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
